	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n9x4b-TBhpVtR3yEQ",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 3, DX 12, IQ 1, HT 10, HP 3, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 10, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 11, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "njW4hGYwA2UI0m_Tk",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 13 (offense 22, protection -9), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nZ1pTahQIbEjXjaJF",
			"text": "Storm of Bodies: No attack roll and no active defense. Storm of Bodies: 1d-4 crushing, Reach C. No attack roll and no defense. The injury is trivial; the effect is that nobody in the hex can see, hear an order, or keep their mouth shut long enough to cast."
		},
		{
			"id": "nFuuGsvw2le_U1Vky",
			"text": "Racial cost: -63 points of traits plus 0 points of skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nkvVslrQDm9Z4d1Ui",
			"text": "Body weight: 6.5 lb."
		},
		{
			"id": "np7m6N0bxd_q8tEXX",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 3; air Move 11 (primary)."
		},
		{
			"id": "nTUIEDvS1QqX9M4IM",
			"text": "One hex is the game entity. A real plague is many of these across a horizon, so place several rather than enlarging one."
		},
